      "$description": "Matches raised, as it already does in light. A bottom sheet carries the same rarity chips and stat colours as a card, and at ink.700 five of those roles fell under 4.5:1. The sheet reads as floating from the scrim behind it and its own radius, not from being a lighter grey.",
